{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17091","headline":"和武相公锦楼翫月得浓字 · 柳公绰","name":"和武相公锦楼翫月得浓字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此夜年年月，偏宜此地逢。\n近看江水浅，遥辨雪山重。\n万井金花肃，千林玉露浓。\n不唯楼上思，飞盖亦陪从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳公绰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}